      "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/channels + https://code.claude.com/docs/en/channels-reference (the feature, verified this session)",
      "charter recommended_patterns.general #2 (seat-vs-incumbent), #7 (org-governance-layer-above-runtime), #8 (promotion-follows-adoption); red_lines (no-vendor-capture)",
      "agent-sdk v0.2 run_seat() + launcher (decisions/proposal-agent-sdk-v0.2-amendment-... + ...-governance-addendum-...) -- the persistent-seat substrate a doorbell sits above"
